/*
    UIDialogInputBox.uss
    Additions on top of UIDialogBox.uss for the input variant.
*/

/*
    Sits under the prompt with room above it, so the sentence asking for the
    value and the field taking it read as one unit rather than two stacked
    controls.

    min-height, not height. Pinned to an exact 26px the TextField cannot grow to
    fit its own text, and the glyphs are clipped at the top and bottom -- reported
    on the guild name prompt, but every caller of this dialog had it: the guild
    MOTD and notice editors, the guild and party invite prompts, rank naming,
    member notes and the friend-list add. The chat input row hit the same wall from
    the other side (see UIChat.uss: pinned to 26px, its inner text element resolved
    to a height of zero and nothing drew at all) and was fixed the same way, by
    letting the field size to its content with a floor under it rather than a
    ceiling over it.
*/
.dialog-input-field {
    min-height: 26px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}
